Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Once, there was a young man who faced\Nmany struggles.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.50,0:00:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how hard he tried, nothing\Nworked out as he hoped.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.50,0:00:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Little by little, he began to lose hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,To his close friend he said: I do not\Nwant to try anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,His friend listened carefully and told\Nhim:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.50,0:00:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Success is not always winning; falling\Nis also life's lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.50,0:00:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if today failed, tomorrow brings a\Nnew chance; you are strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.50,0:00:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The young man smiled softly and began to\Ntry again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.50,0:01:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Failure is not the end; as long as there\Nis hope, there is a new beginning.
